      "traits": [
        "acid",
        "arcane"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The water scamp breathes acid in a 15ft Cone that deals 2d6 Acid Damage damage to each creature within the area (Basic DC 17 Reflex Saving Throw save).</p>\n<p>The water scamp can't use Acid Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
